WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.992
The bunnies were sad.

2
00:00:03.993 --> 00:00:07.239
All the candy was gone.

3
00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:10.862
The mouse's boot was stuck.

4
00:00:10.863 --> 00:00:14.499
"We must tell the mouse," Benjamin said.

5
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:19.006
"She will be mad," Peter said.

6
00:00:19.007 --> 00:00:22.555
"Look! Here she comes."

7
00:00:22.556 --> 00:00:27.200
The mouse ran toward the bunnies.

8
00:00:27.201 --> 00:00:30.179
Suddenly she stopped.

9
00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:33.009
"My boot!"

10
00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:37.801
The mouse gasped.

11
00:00:37.802 --> 00:00:42.647
"Did someone paint a picture on my boot?"

12
00:00:42.648 --> 00:00:45.488
"Yes," Benjamin said.

13
00:00:45.489 --> 00:00:52.971
"Mrs. Tiggywinkle painted a picture on your boot."

14
00:00:52.972 --> 00:00:56.914
The mouse looked inside the boot.

15
00:00:56.915 --> 00:01:01.203
"Did someone put feathers in my boot?"

16
00:01:01.204 --> 00:01:04.030
"Yes," Peter said.

17
00:01:04.031 --> 00:01:07.887
"Jemima put feathers in your boot."

18
00:01:07.888 --> 00:01:10.345
The mouse looked at the rocks.

19
00:01:10.346 --> 00:01:15.259
"Did someone get my boot stuck?"

20
00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:18.716
"Yes," Benjamin said sadly.

21
00:01:18.717 --> 00:01:28.252
"And we can't get it out."

22
00:01:28.253 --> 00:01:34.054
The mouse laughed.

23
00:01:34.055 --> 00:01:39.891
"Now my boot is pretty. My bed is soft.

24
00:01:39.892 --> 00:01:43.972
And nobody can take my boot!"

25
00:01:43.973 --> 00:01:49.744
Peter and Benjamin laughed too.

26
00:01:49.745 --> 00:01:54.364
"Thank you for finding my house," the mouse said.

27
00:01:54.365 --> 00:02:00.778
"I found something for you too."

28
00:02:00.779 --> 00:02:12.019
The mouse held out their candy!

